  m_Name: SoupKitchen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: soup_kitchen
  playerChoiceText: 'How are things at the soup kitchen?

'
  lines:
  - speaker: Mama Nandi
    text: Busy, as always. Some days we run out of bread by noon.
  - speaker: Player
    text: That many people come for food?
  - speaker: Mama Nandi
    text: More than I ever thought I'd see. Young ones, old ones..
  - speaker: Player
    text: "It\u2019s heartbreaking."
  - speaker: Mama Nandi
    text: Heartbreaking, yes. But also motivating...
  unlockTask: {fileID: 0}
